      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1612904740,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I ran `git log -p` and searched for both \"GPL-3.0\" (as in SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later) and \"version 3 of the License\" (as in the full GPL v3 text) and only found matches for PIDL and Autotools. I did not find any matches for any code that makes up any of the executables that we ship.",
